340
00:21:29,657 --> 00:21:31,793
Lucy O'Connor.
You can call me "Lou".

341
00:21:31,926 --> 00:21:33,393
Okay, Lou.

342
00:21:34,327 --> 00:21:37,832
Uh, so she was some kinda,
like, reporter, right?

343
