462
00:30:13,648 --> 00:30:15,249
- Hey, Daddy.
<i>- Hey.</i>

463
00:30:15,550 --> 00:30:17,918
Thought I'd call you back
and see how you're doing.

464
00:30:18,586 --> 00:30:20,187
Yeah, uh, they...

465
