485
00:31:10,037 --> 00:31:12,106
<i>It's just, um, today hit home.</i>

486
00:31:12,172 --> 00:31:15,109
I... I keep, uh...
I keep thinking about Mom.

487
00:31:15,409 --> 00:31:16,910
<i>Lou, we've been through this.</i>

488
00:31:17,211 --> 00:31:18,078
